# Structural ontology index (deploy#493). code-graph.json is a single committed
# JSON file modified by parallel wave-branch PRs when Python source changes.
# Without a merge driver, concurrent feature branches that each update the index
# produce a git conflict on every merge even when their changes are disjoint
# (feedback_parallel_panels_shared_file). The `ontology-codegraph` union driver
# (noorinalabs-main#855 .claude/lib/ontology_gen/merge_driver.py) merges disjoint
# node/edge additions non-conflictingly. Register it per-clone with:
#   python3 scripts/structural_ontology.py register-merge-driver
# (or `make setup-hooks` if Makefile is added later).
ontology/structural/code-graph.json merge=ontology-codegraph
